  "content_html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh_hfpAsQ4kuIHOKppcLJhMRb2FEK56hC20xRqIykHuIZw1WIAjpFfbPlyjAraatdjR_ip0NhnDMJe2TLeKcjm-wR8PODBqbqJXxrfDhDyO_VsMR2fDQrQzoa4un8FDwHUmN9MFHJgCyxx1gZQT-3ECsp89AUZdonb3i1lsxVlMS2sa-hp4QeJ8TdkPJpE/s1024/Designer%20-%202024-09-19T214037.231.jpeg\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh_hfpAsQ4kuIHOKppcLJhMRb2FEK56hC20xRqIykHuIZw1WIAjpFfbPlyjAraatdjR_ip0NhnDMJe2TLeKcjm-wR8PODBqbqJXxrfDhDyO_VsMR2fDQrQzoa4un8FDwHUmN9MFHJgCyxx1gZQT-3ECsp89AUZdonb3i1lsxVlMS2sa-hp4QeJ8TdkPJpE/w320-h320/Designer%20-%202024-09-19T214037.231.jpeg\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">השאלון התעסוקתי המלא</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רָאשֵׁיכֶם שִׁבְטֵיכֶם זִקְנֵיכֶם וְשֹׁטְרֵיכֶם ... מֵחֹטֵב עֵצֶיךָ, עַד שֹׁאֵב מֵימֶיךָ</span></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִירִיד הַתַּעֲסוּקָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בָּאוּ רַבִּים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַצִּיגִים הַתְאָמָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּשּׁוּרִים וּקְשָׁרִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָז, הִנֵּה אֲנִי בָּא,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהַגִּישׁ לָכֶם סַעַד.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְיַחַד, בַּסַּדְנָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נִצְעַד לְלֹא רַעַד.</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּאַמְתַּחְתִּי, סִדְרַת שְׁאֵלוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְגִלּוּי הַתְאָמָה וְאֹפִי.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהַשָּׂגַת הַתְאָמוֹת מֵרַבִּיּוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְלֹא הֲטָלַת דֹּפִי.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַשְּׁאֵלוֹן, לִשְׁנֵי הַמִּינִים מְיֹעָד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מְנֻסָּח&nbsp;לְשׁוֹן זָכָר לְשֵׁם הַנּוֹחוּת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַתְאִים הוּא לִגְבָרִים וְנָשִׁים, כְּאֶחָד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תּוֹךְ שְׁמִירָה עַל גִּדְרֵי הַצְּנִיעוּת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">💦 </span><u>שׁוֹאֵב מַיִם</u></span></h4><p><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><i>עושה מלאכתו בהשקט וענווה, ומספק מים ומחייה לקהילה</i></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַאִם אַתָּה תּוֹפֵס, כִּזְכוּת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְסַיֵּיעַ, לַעֲזֹר לָתֵת שֵׁרוּת?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַאִם הַדָּבָר מֵסֵב לְךָ אֹשֶׁר?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַתַּעֲדִיף זֹאת עַל עֲשִׂיַּת עֹשֶׁר?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַאִם מִלָּה כְּמוֹ אֶמְפַּטְיָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַסְעִירָה אֶת דִּמְיוֹנְךָ?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וַהֲכָלָה? וְסִימְפַּטְיָה?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"נִשְׁפָּכוֹת\" מִמְּךָ?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי אָז, אֵין כָּמוֹךָ מַתְאִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִשְׁאֹב מַיִם בִּדְלָיִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְסַפֵּק אוֹפְּיוּם לַהֲמוֹנִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּאֶחָד מֵהַמִּקְצוֹעוֹת הַהוּמָנִיִּים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תּוּכַל לִהְיוֹת רַבִּי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אוֹ לָתֵת סַעַד וּרְוָחָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הֱיֵה&nbsp;עוֹבֵד סוֹצְיָאלִי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַדְרִיךְ אוֹ עוֹבֵד הוֹרָאָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַמֵּשׁ&nbsp;מְיֻמָּנוּיוֹת רַכּוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַפְעֵל מָנִיפּוּלַצְיָה וּרְגָשׁוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אוּלַי גַּם תָּקִים עֲמֻתּוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עֶזְרָה לְמִשְׁפָּחוֹת נִזְקָקוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תּוּכַל לִמְכֹּר סַמִּים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִהְיוֹת זַמַּר חֲתֻנּוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לַעֲבֹד עִם אֲנָשִׁים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לָתֵת לְחַיּוֹת לִחְיוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🪓 </span><u>חוֹטֵב עֵצִים</u></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><i style=\"color: #990000;\">לחישוב זווית הנפילה ועוצמת המכה, דרושים תכנון ומקצועיות רבה</i></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּאן יִמָּצְאוּ מַתְאִימִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַנְשֵׁי מַדָּעִים מְדֻיָּקִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּאֵלּוּ שֶׁעוֹרְכִים חִשּׁוּבִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זָוִיּוֹת וְטַבְלָאוֹת מֶרְחַקִּים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָעוֹלָם זָקוּק לְנַגָּרִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְטֶּכְנַאי לְצַלָּם לְצַלָּף.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לאַדְרִיכָל וְשַׂרְטָטִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֹפִי,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הָלַךְ לְךָ קְלָף.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תִּתְרַגֵּל, תִּתְמַקְצֵעַ, תְּשַׁנֵּן נְהָלִים</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תַּרְגֵּם הַשְׁקָעָתְךָ לַהֲנָבַת יְבוּל,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי בְּתֹם תְּקוּפַת הַלִּמּוּדִים</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַשָּׁמַיִם - הֵם בִּלְבַד הַגְּבוּל.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">👔 </span><u>מַנְהִיג</u></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><i style=\"color: #990000;\">אל תחכה לקבל סמכויות, פשוט קח אותן, ותתחיל להיות</i></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בֵּין שֶׁקָּרָאתָ עַד לְכָאן,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבֶטַח אִם יָשָׁר קָפַצְתָּ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הֲרֵי שֶׁאַתָּה בָּעִנְיָין,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִהְיוֹת זָכָר אַלְפָא.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהוֹבִיל, לְנַוֵּט, לְהַשְׁפִּיעַ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִגְזֹר הַחְלָטוֹת גּוֹרָלִיּוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִשְׁקֹל וְאַף לְהַכְרִיעַ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִלְחָמוֹת וְסִדְרֵי עֲדִיפוּיוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תּוּכַל 'לָתֵת בָּרֹאשׁ',</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהוֹבִיל מְדִינָה אוֹ אֶרֶץ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רַק הַקְפֵּד לִבְלֹט כִּבְרוֹשׁ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לַחֲסֹם פִּרְצָה וּפֶרֶץ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְמִצְעָר, תּוּכַל לִהְיוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יוֹשֵׁב רֹאשׁ וַעַד הַבִּנְיָן.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי בְּאֵין מַשֶּׁהוּ אַחֵר לַעֲשׂוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גַּם בְּזֶה יִמָּצֵא עִנְיָן.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">👮 </span><u>שׁוֹטֵר</u></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><i style=\"color: #990000;\">קידומך איטי - אך מובטח, ובלבד שלא תגזים ותסרח</i></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בּוֹאוּ הֵנָּה חוֹבְבֵי הַסֵּדֶר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נוֹפְפוּ וְהָנִיפוּ אַלּוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פַּזְּרוּ אֶת הַפְגָּנוֹת הָעֵדֶר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי סֵדֶר חַיָּיב לִהְיוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֵאָז וּמֵעוֹלָם, בִּקֵּשׁ כָּל מִשְׁטָר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַנְשֵׁי שְׁרִירִים וּזְרוֹעוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּאֵלּוּ שֶׁיַּעַמְדוּ עַל הַמִּשְׁמָר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִפְּנֵי אַסְפִּירַצְיוֹת פּוֹלִיטִיּוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">דְּרוּשִׁים שׁוֹפְטִים וְשׁוֹפְטוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מְאַבְטְחִים וְחֶבְרוֹת שְׁמִירָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עוֹרְכֵי בּוֹרְרוּיוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רֵגוּלָטוֹרִים עוֹבְדֵי מְדִינָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🚶 </span><u>סְתָם אִישׁ</u></span></h4><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל אִם אַתָּה, סְתָם אִישׁ רָגִיל,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּזֶה מִן אָפֹר - אִישׁ בְּלִי גִּיל.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לֹא נִיצַּחְתָּ בַּקְּרָב, לֹא הוֹבַלְתָּ&nbsp;תַּרְגִּיל,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲפִילּוּ בְּעֵינֵי עַצְמְךָ - נִרְאֶה כָּפִיל.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בּוֹא לְכָאן, תֵּשֵׁב תָּנוּחַ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תִּהְיֶה פָּשׁוּט - 'כָּל אִישׁ יִשְׂרָאֵל'.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שַׁלֵּב&nbsp;חַיֵּי חֹמֶר בְּחַיֵּי רוּחַ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבָא לְךָ וּלְצִיּוֹן גּוֹאֵל...</span></p>"
}
